  "notes": "16-seed Run 2 library declustering on libA_run2's library, NO distance cap (random among the 20 nearest), library cache 1 per worker; D.5 on the 16-seed mean + seed study. Compare with declib16_run2_20261003_f7183e9-9ae5088 (capped). RESULT (exit 0 2026-10-04 00:33, no hot patches; 3 D3 jobs retried once): vs capped declib16_run2: same draw for the same event in two seeds 8.4% -> 3.6%, identical events 2.4% -> 1.7%, single-candidate lookups 4.0% -> 0; N_eff (16 seeds, weighted rho, biased low by per-bin clipping) for SR/SB shapes 3.3-6 -> 3.5-5.6 (canJet3 pT SR 13.8, noisy); D.5 closure (16-seed mean) data/Bkg presel 1.006, passDiJetMass 1.010, SR 1.015, SB 1.007 (capped, seed 4: 1.005/1.008/1.013/1.006). Worker memory ~1.5 GB with library cache 1; daemon peaked ~5.8 GB on 11 GB cmslpc324 without OOM.",
